## What This Project Does
 
This project contains a Playwright-based E2E test suite that documents the
**agreed behavioural baseline** of the pre-migration web application.
 
Every test scenario was derived from static analysis of the original web project:
`.aspx` markup, VB/C# code-behinds, JavaScript files, user controls, and
referenced business classes. All generated code is C#.
 
The test suite proves **functional equivalence** post-migration: if all tests
pass against the migrated application, the migration preserved the original
behaviour.
 
