## Prerequisites
 
- .NET 9 SDK
- `E2E_BASE_URL` environment variable set to the running application URL
 
Install Playwright browsers (run once):
 
```powershell
dotnet build
pwsh bin/Debug/net9.0/playwright.ps1 install chromium
```
 
---
 
## Running Tests
 
**Against the pre-migration app** (baseline):
 
```powershell
$env:E2E_BASE_URL = "http://localhost:5000"   # or the actual pre-migration URL
dotnet test
```
 
**Against the post-migration app** (equivalence check):
 
```powershell
$env:E2E_BASE_URL = "http://localhost:5001"   # or the actual post-migration URL
dotnet test
```
 
