## Do Not
 
- Modify `Specs/{PageName}Tests.cs` to make failing tests pass post-migration.
  A failing test means a genuine behavioural difference — investigate it.
- Add `[Ignore]` attributes post-migration to hide failures.
- Change expected outcome text in assertions to match incorrect post-migration
  behaviour.